 │                                                                                                                                  ││ ── description ───────────────────────────────────────────────── │
 │                                                                                                                                  ││ Invoices and their line items, with the totals worked out in the │
 │                                                                                                                                  ││ money package from #301.                                         │
 │                                                                                                                                  ││                                                                  │
 │                                                                                                                                  ││ An invoice is immutable once finalized. Corrections are new      │
 │                                                                                                                                  ││ invoices that point at the one they replace, so the ledger never │
 │                                                                                                                                  ││ rewrites history.                                                │
 │                                                                                                                                  ││                                                                  │
